WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
Reconciled, there are two pairs

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,840
Two smoked fish, a pack of salt, three pieces of dried meat

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:07,020
Why does he have two fish?

4
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,060
I only have three pieces of jerky

5
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,260
That fish is bigger than dried meat

6
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,660
He is like a horse's firewood

7
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,860
You can't move it in two days

8
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,540
I only recognize my life, not my mouth

9
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:14,820
I'll come again next week

10
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,050
I'm coming too

11
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,330
I'll do double the work next week

12
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:20,890
Working is not about shouting slogans

13
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:22,490
Wait until you see the real seal in your hand

14
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:31,270
So salty

15
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:35,420
Lin Nuo, what about yours? I proved it myself, so don’t worry about it.

16
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:37,260
Two fish and a few pieces of dried meat

17
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,500
Just bought everyone

18
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:40,950
A bunch of weaklings

19
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:42,510
You have strong bones

20
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:47,040
Can I have a full stomach? The old rules

21
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,000
Half goes into labor account

22
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,000
half to myself

23
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,120
Another knife

24
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,000
firewood pile

25
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,120
Why don't you need manpower?

26
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:56,200
It's too little. You've taken the responsibility yourself. OK, OK, you have the final say.

27
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:09,020
Why are we all here standing guard?

28
00:01:09,020 --> 00:01:10,540
Just come and take a look

29
00:01:11,370 --> 00:01:13,290
Look, I can see that my stomach is full

30
00:01:13,290 --> 00:01:15,410
I'm in a good mood today. I'll treat you to a treat.

31
00:01:15,810 --> 00:01:25,140
Whoever grabs it will be counted as the one who takes it. Chase me, Xiao Tang.

32
00:01:25,140 --> 00:01:26,420
You can't steal things

33
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:27,500
eat

34
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,780
You want to scold me for being the first one?

35
00:01:29,780 --> 00:01:31,220
Go back to the camp and curse behind closed doors

36
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:32,620
Don't be embarrassed here

37
00:01:34,140 --> 00:01:35,980
You can grab me and wait for the boat.
